<title>PAKISTAN: Three injured in second bomb blast in Karachi.</title>
<headline>Three injured in second bomb blast in Karachi.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>At least three people were injured in a second bomb explosion on Wednesday near government offices in the Pakistani port city of Karachi, police said.</p>
</text>
